Santiago acquired Kunoichi's [[Amulet]] at an unknown time.

Santiago invoked Kunoichi in the great battle at the [[Blood Spiral Base]]. Kunoichi defeated numerous [[Bazela's Insect]] Titans. {{Source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

Later on in the battle, Kunoichi cut a hole in a [[Scramjet]] to rescue [[LeBlanche]]. Santiago, LeBlanche and Kunoichi then jumped to safety before the Scram-jet exploded. {{Source|Dante's Return}}
